# 🌑 AETHERIA — CHARACTER / HERO SYSTEM

> **A Hero is not merely a unit.**
>
> Every Hero is a survivor, warrior, scholar, mage, craftsman, or individual who carries the history of the world that was destroyed.
>
> The **Character / Hero System** manages every Hero that exists in Aetheria.
>
> Hero creation and acquisition are fundamentally connected to the **RNG System**, while the **Game State System** determines how each Hero affects and is affected by the world.
>
> The core identity of every Hero is derived from the **Core World Building**. A Hero is not created as an isolated combat unit, but as a living part of Aetheria's races, civilizations, factions, cultures, histories, conflicts, and world events.
>
> Hero development does not use EXP. Heroes develop through **Gold investment** and gain permanent stat growth through **experience earned by completing Tower floors**.

