# 4. HERO INSTANCE

A Hero is not only a template.

The system separates:

```text
HERO TEMPLATE
```

and

```text
HERO INSTANCE
```

### Hero Template

Defines the basic character and its connection to the Core World Building.

```text
Hero Template
├── Name
├── Race
├── Civilization
├── Culture
├── Faction
├── Origin
├── Background
├── Class
├── Base Stats
├── Skills
├── Personality
├── World-Building References
└── Story
```

### Hero Instance

Represents the actual Hero owned by the Master.

```text
Hero Instance
├── Character ID
├── Hero Template ID
├── Master ID
├── Level
├── Gold Invested
├── Floor Experience
├── Star
├── Current Stats
├── Equipment
├── Relationship
├── Memory
├── Personal World-State Changes
└── Status
```

This separation allows the same Hero design to exist as a template while each recruited Hero has individual progression, memories, relationships, and consequences.

