# 7. HERO CREATION FLOW

Hero creation is based on the Core World Building and the RNG System.

```text
CORE WORLD BUILDING
      ↓
AVAILABLE HERO POOLS
      ↓
RNG REQUEST
      ↓
RNG SYSTEM
      ↓
Rarity Result
      ↓
Race / Civilization / Faction Pool
      ↓
Hero Template Selection
      ↓
Duplicate Check
      ↓
Character Instance
      ↓
CHARACTER ID
      ↓
DATABASE
```

The RNG System selects from valid world-based Hero Pools.

The Character System then creates the Hero Instance.

