# 8. RNG SYSTEM AS THE FOUNDATION

The RNG System is responsible for random determination.

The Character System does not independently decide which Hero is obtained.

Instead:

```text
CORE WORLD BUILDING
      ↓
VALID HERO POOL
      ↓
RNG SYSTEM
      ↓
RANDOM RESULT
      ↓
CHARACTER SYSTEM
