```

RNG can be used by:

```text
Recruitment
Enemy Loot
Floor Rewards
Quest Rewards
Events
Exploration
Special Content
World Encounters
Faction Encounters
```

The RNG System may determine the result, but the result must remain consistent with the rules of the Core World Building.

