# 15. HERO FLOOR EXPERIENCE

Heroes do not gain EXP from ordinary combat, quests, or training.

Instead, Heroes gain development experience through successfully completing Tower floors.

```text
TOWER FLOOR COMPLETED
          ↓
HERO PARTICIPATION CHECK
          ↓
FLOOR EXPERIENCE AWARDED
          ↓
HERO EXPERIENCE RECORD UPDATED
          ↓
STAT DEVELOPMENT
```

Floor Experience represents the Hero's practical growth through real Tower challenges.

It is not a consumable currency.

It is a permanent progression record connected to the Hero's Tower journey.

---

# 16. FLOOR EXPERIENCE RULES

A Hero can receive Floor Experience when:

```text
The Hero is deployed on the floor
The Hero participates in the floor challenge
The Hero survives or contributes to the completion
The floor is successfully cleared
```

The exact reward can be influenced by:

```text
Floor Number
Floor Difficulty
Mission Type
Hero Participation
Hero Performance
Special Floor Conditions
World State
Event State
```

A Hero who does not participate in the floor should not automatically receive the same experience as a deployed Hero.

