# 18. FLOOR EXPERIENCE AND LEVEL

Floor Experience and Level are connected but serve different purposes.

```text
GOLD
 ↓
LEVEL
 ↓
BASE STAT INCREASE
```

and:

```text
TOWER FLOOR EXPERIENCE
 ↓
PRACTICAL DEVELOPMENT
 ↓
STAT GROWTH
 ↓
SPECIAL DEVELOPMENT
```

Level represents the Hero's formal development through Gold investment.

Floor Experience represents the Hero's practical development through Tower experience.

A Hero may have a high Level but limited Floor Experience.

A Hero may also have significant Floor Experience while requiring additional Gold investment to reach their full potential.

