# 47. NO DUPLICATE HERO

A Hero cannot be recruited twice by the same Master.

```text
RNG RESULT
     ↓
CHARACTER ID / TEMPLATE
     ↓
CHECK MASTER COLLECTION
     ↓
Already Owned?
   ┌───┴───┐
  YES      NO
   │        │
 ROLL      CREATE
 AGAIN     HERO
```

The duplicate check must happen before finalizing the recruitment transaction.

The system must also verify that the Hero is still valid under the current:

```text
World State
Faction State
Event State
Recruitment Rules
```

