# 48. RNG RE-ROLL

If RNG produces an already-owned Hero:

```text
Duplicate
   ↓
RNG Re-roll
   ↓
New Hero
```

The system must prevent infinite loops.

Recommended:

```text
Maximum Re-roll Attempts
        ↓
Fallback Pool
        ↓
Guaranteed Unowned Hero
```

This prevents recruitment failure when the player's collection becomes large.

If no valid Hero remains in the current pool, the system may use:

```text
Alternative World-Based Pool
Guaranteed Reward
Recruitment Material
Special Conversion
```

