# 🌑 91. CORE PHILOSOPHY

The Character / Hero System follows one important principle:

> **A Hero is generated by the system, but their identity is inherited from the world and completed by their journey.**

The Core World Building determines where the Hero comes from.

The RNG System determines how the Hero enters the Master's world.

The Character System determines who that Hero is.

The Master provides Gold and determines how the Hero is developed.

The Tower determines where the Hero gains practical experience.

Floor completion determines how the Hero's stats develop through experience.

The AI determines how the Hero behaves.

The Event System determines what happens to the Hero.

The Game State System remembers the consequences.

The Database System remembers the Hero's entire history.

```text
CORE WORLD BUILDING
 ↓
RACE
 ↓
CIVILIZATION
 ↓
FACTION
 ↓
HERO
 ↓
MASTER
 ↓
GOLD INVESTMENT
 ↓
LEVEL
 ↓
TOWER
 ↓
FLOOR COMPLETION
 ↓
FLOOR EXPERIENCE
 ↓
STAT DEVELOPMENT
 ↓
MEMORY
 ↓
RELATIONSHIP
 ↓
EVENT
 ↓
WORLD-STATE CONSEQUENCE
 ↓
PROGRESSION
 ↓
ASCENSION
 ↓
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
```

> **A Hero does not become important because the RNG gave them a high Star.**
>
> **A Hero becomes important because they carry the history of their world, grow through the Gold invested by the Master, and gain real experience through the floors they survive and complete inside the Tower.**

