# ✨ 92. AETHERIA HERO PRINCIPLE

Every Hero should be capable of becoming part of the story.

A ⭐1 Hero may begin as an insignificant survivor.

A ⭐5 Hero may begin as a legendary warrior.

But both can:

```text
Come from a Meaningful Civilization
Carry a Cultural Identity
Belong to a Faction
Experience Events
Build Relationships
Gain Memories
Change Personality
Develop Loyalty
Survive Floors
Gain Floor Experience
Develop Stats Through Experience
Lose Companions
Make Decisions
Challenge Their Origin
Change Their Faction
Change the World
```

Therefore:

> **Core World Building determines identity.**

> **Rarity determines potential and availability.**

> **Gold determines formal level development.**

> **Tower experience determines practical stat development.**

> **Progression determines strength.**

> **Experience determines personal identity.**

> **The Master determines direction.**

> **The Game State System determines consequence.**

And ultimately:

# **Every Hero has a world behind them, a Tower journey within them, and a story ahead of them.**
